This directory vendors the inference-path subset of RestoreFormer++
(the RestoreFormer wrapper class, its VQVAE arch, and a download helper —
not the training scripts or data loaders).

Source: https://github.com/wzhouxiff/RestoreFormerPlusPlus
License: Apache License 2.0 (see UPSTREAM_LICENSE)

RestoreFormer.py is patched from upstream: added a face_model_rootpath
parameter so facexlib loads PicMedic's bundled local weights instead of
downloading them at runtime (see the comment at the top of that file).
